{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/5e48566d3f542c8792657de3380a48cf.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span>Aliens have come to The Planet!  Help Kitsy Katsy survive the tides of oncoming otherworldly enemies to harvest, recruit, build, upgrade, and craft the way to victory!  Hmm?  What's that?  Was that name picked by a toddler or something?  Why yes!  Yes it was.  Thanks for noticing!  And you can expect plenty more exquisitely high-quality content like that to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/1f5944898b3cec868caa85005941e6c4.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/7cda7ab45c0df3053fae2601dffffc1e.poster.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/7cda7ab45c0df3053fae2601dffffc1e.webm?t=1760722983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>With a bizarre smushing together of two very different genres, Cats vs. Aliens lets you enjoy the cozy game loops of farm sims and base builders alongside the  dodge-and-pray combat of bullet heaven roguelites. Create a lovely little home to chill in, then take to the diverse biomes of The Planet to gather rare resources to help help you create a better home to let you gather more resources to help you create a better home, to help you.... you get it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/ad9555a362000fe7beccd516d1bfff8f.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/d273219a562aa04ea62e57b633e9aaae.poster.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/d273219a562aa04ea62e57b633e9aaae.webm?t=1760722983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Gather items while dodging enemies that are flying at you from all directions.  Survive long enough to get back to safety and get crafting, baby!  Use your gathered resources to craft upgrades for your next excursion, or stockpile them to upgrade your home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/2ee312eadec27ea426b512cdd4d736fd.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/b6bd88de63ae00ad7c879dec0fc8ef50.poster.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/b6bd88de63ae00ad7c879dec0fc8ef50.webm?t=1760722983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With combat and levelling inspired by roguelite and survivorslike titles, you can create new builds every time you leave your base.\u00a0 Grow your powers, expand you collection of upgrades, and find the most game-breaking builds fathomable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/08a65180ad6adca96509d6708f2d5997.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/1d964c61118e87dce141efc09d052cdd.poster.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/1d964c61118e87dce141efc09d052cdd.webm?t=1760722983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Kitsy Katsy isn't alone!  Explore the world to find and recruit the many lovingly crafted playable characters that each bring their own exciting unlockable something or other to the game.\u00a0 Play as any character you unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/095e8c7088d73f917db02939cf9123a3.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/b910fa451f8c875541b72a83e8b1b5d6.poster.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/b910fa451f8c875541b72a83e8b1b5d6.webm?t=1760722983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Visit a world contrived by the moderately deranged mind of Echo in a Void - you know, that dapper solodeveloper that made this game you're looking at RIGHT MEOW!  With hand drawn (and hand-pixelled) artwork by Echo, Cats vs. Aliens offers you a truly unique experience that you won't find anywhere else.  At least until the next game.  I'll have to change this description at that point.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2896390?t=1760722983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760722983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760722983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760722983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest For Cats vs Aliens!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtesting phase 2 starts on January 10th!\u00a0 Click that &quot;Request Access&quot; button right meow so that you can be notified the moment it opens.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/5e48566d3f542c8792657de3380a48cf.avif?t=1760722983\" width=620 height=81 /></span>Aliens have come to The Planet!  Help Kitsy Katsy survive the tides of oncoming otherworldly enemies to harvest, recruit, build, upgrade, and craft the way to victory!  Hmm?  What's that?  Was that name picked by a toddler or something?  Why yes!  Yes it was.  Thanks for noticing!  And you can expect plenty more exquisitely high-quality content like that to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896390/extras/1f5944898b3cec868ca